			<i>Adj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">frons,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. F.
					4, 656</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pocula,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					E. 3, 37</span></i>
			: 
